        "text_copy_copy": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-c26bb7a766@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-7a617b9e44@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Fri Feb 28 2020 17:00:49 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<h3><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Flip-up footrests</span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">The footrests remain in an upright position to provide a clear path of patient ingress and egress, which helps reduce trip hazards for patients and caregivers. Foot-operated levers allow caregivers to position patients with reduced bending and help prevent transfer of germs and debris from touching dirty footrests. With Swing Away functionality, an intuitive foot-operated button swings footrests back and out of the way to provide closer access to beds, cars or tables, and offers unobstructed access to patients.</span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Sep 16 2024 19:56:19 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
      "col2": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "standaloneimage_copy": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
